  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_01",
      "hash64": "293FAB0CFE603190",
      "text": "Anda, veo que tenemos algunas caras nuevas\\nen clase.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_02",
      "hash64": "293FAE0CFE6036A9",
      "text": "Soy Cloe, la encargada de que vuestras jóvenes\\ncabecitas aprendan todo lo necesario acerca de\\r\\nnuestro pasado.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_03",
      "hash64": "293FAD0CFE6034F6",
      "text": "La historia es algo maravilloso, ¡casi mágico!\\c\\nLas vidas de nuestros antecesores asentaron los\\ncimientos del mundo tal y como lo conocemos.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_04",
      "hash64": "293FB00CFE603A0F",
      "text": "Hoy me gustaría hablaros acerca del rincón más\\nrecóndito de toda Paldea: cierto foso rodeado\\r\\nde misterio.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_05",
      "hash64": "293FAF0CFE60385C",
      "text": "Como ya sabréis, en el corazón de nuestra región\\nse encuentra un gigantesco cráter conocido como\\r\\n\"el foso de Paldea\".[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_06",
      "hash64": "293FB20CFE603D75",
      "text": "Sus entrañas reciben el nombre de \"Área Cero\",\\ny los estudios geológicos llevados a cabo para\\r\\nanalizar sus estratos y sedimentos afirman que\\r\\neste se formó hace más de un millón de años.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 191,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_07",
      "hash64": "293FB10CFE603BC2",
      "text": "Es más, corren rumores de que el fondo de ese\\nenorme foso rodeado de misterio esconde [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]algo[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\r\\ndesde hace mucho pero que mucho tiempo.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_08",
      "hash64": "293FB40CFE6040DB",
      "text": "Uy, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\c\\nHas tenido la mala suerte de mirarme a los ojos\\nen el peor momento. Lo siento, te ha tocado.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_09",
      "hash64": "293FB30CFE603F28",
      "text": "¿Puedes decirnos qué reposa en el interior del\\nfoso de Paldea, es decir, en lo más profundo del\\r\\nÁrea Cero, según los rumores?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_c_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "50FDDD95E00E4240",
      "text": "Un tesoro",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_c_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "50FDE095E00E4759",
      "text": "Un Snorlax",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_c_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "50FDDF95E00E45A6",
      "text": "Un Centro Pokémon",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_answer_01",
      "hash64": "4FAD04F0C0143E09",
      "text": "¡Je! ¡Correcto! Veo que tenemos entre nosotros\\na todo un cerebrito. Así me gusta, que vengáis a\\r\\nclase con el temario leído.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_answer_02",
      "hash64": "4FAD01F0C01438F0",
      "text": "Una respuesta adorable, pero no. No hacía falta\\ntomarse lo de que \"reposa\" tan al pie de la letra.\\c\\nLa respuesta correcta es... ¡un tesoro![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_answer_03",
      "hash64": "4FAD02F0C0143AA3",
      "text": "Imaginación no te falta, ¿eh? Eso está claro.\\nSi encontraran un Centro Pokémon allí abajo,\\r\\nsería un verdadero anacronismo.\\c\\nLa respuesta correcta es... ¡un tesoro![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_10",
      "hash64": "293C460CFE5D501A",
      "text": "Como lo oís. De hecho, se llegó a decir que el\\ntesoro oculto en las entrañas del foso era más\\r\\nvalioso que todas las riquezas del mundo juntas.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_11",
      "hash64": "293C470CFE5D51CD",
      "text": "Una lástima que los sueños y la sed de aventuras\\nde tantos se fueran al cuerno con la construcción\\r\\nde un laboratorio en la zona...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_12",
      "hash64": "293C440CFE5D4CB4",
      "text": "A todo esto, os recuerdo que el acceso al foso\\nde Paldea y al Área Cero está terminantemente\\r\\nprohibido a la gente de a pie.\\c\\nY eso obviamente os incluye a vosotros.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 169,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_13",
      "hash64": "293C450CFE5D4E67",
      "text": "Así que nada de meteros donde no debéis,\\npor muchas ganas que tengáis de jugar a los\\r\\ncazatesoros, ¿ha quedado claro?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_14",
      "hash64": "293C420CFE5D494E",
      "text": "Creedme, si fuera tan fácil, ¡sería la primera en\\nlanzarme de cabeza a explorar el foso![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_15",
      "hash64": "293C430CFE5D4B01",
      "text": "¡Oh! ¿Yaaa? La clase se me ha pasado volando.\\nNo irá adelantado el reloj o algo, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_c_01_history_16",
      "hash64": "293C400CFE5D45E8",
      "text": "En fin, pues supongo que eso es todo por hoy.\\n¡Más entresijos históricos en la próxima clase![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
